<title>USA: 8x8 IPO size increased/range decreased-underwriter.</title>
<headline>8x8 IPO size increased/range decreased-underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>8x8 Inc's initial public offering size has been increased to 3.6 million shares from 2.5 million shares, said lead underwriter Montgomery Securities.</p>
<p>In addition, the range for the deal has been reduced to $6 to $8 from $8 to $10.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to price during the week of June 30.</p>
<p>8x8 Inc makes software to compress video.</p>
</text>
